Glasseek changes: native Hermes schemas; web_search/web_extract; no Scholar,
manual context update, XML or think-boundary instructions; original-passage
retrieval instead of summarization; bounded execution/review; no shortest-path
shortcut; complete report/table policies for datasets without an upstream bundle.
The benchmark judges remain Glasseek's separately pinned native evaluators.
This adaptation is not a claim to reproduce AREX-2's published scores.
